o detail, and your drawing ability to reveal the character's personality.\n\nI would love to have you draw one of my characters. There is no situation specified, and a solid background is fine.\nI would like you to draw a character named \"Tokieda Mangetsu,\" a character created by myself for TRPG and DX3rd.\nI would be happy if you could check the following URL for materials.\n\nIllustration\nhttps://twitter.com/orionza_trpg/status/1600285900831096832?s=61&t=5S1qLkTBu8kiYEowOQ879A\nhttps://twitter.com/orionza_trpg/status/1614279749869916160?s=61&t=5S1qLkTBu8kiYEowOQ879A\nCharacter sheet\nhttps://yutorize.2-d.jp/ytsheet/dx3rd/?id=RDUQjO\nThere is no back drawing, so you may draw freely.\n\nTo capture the character's setting, she is a type of character known as an awakening frame in Double Cross, and she awakens to her special abilities during the story.\nHer ability allows her to fight by changing her arms like black coral reefs, liquefy her legs and manipulate them at will, and move at high speed.\nShe is a strong girl with a strong personality, but at her core she is kind and sometimes smiles.\n\nWe will continue to support you, Hibiki Hurt.\nI eagerly await your work!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 705325, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ねこまち", "screen_name": "Neko__machi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2004567691261358080/3mSbEkKs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1038399036804349952/1697674817/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 1790502, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "すがのたすく", "sc